    "title": "Buchanan High Freshman Max Jauregui Named Clovis Crush Student-Athlete of the Week for Cross Country - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 minutes ago Max Jauregui, a freshman at Buchanan High School, has been named the Clovis Crush Student-Athlete of the Week for men's cross country. He finished sixth at the Northern California Regional Championships and was the top performer for his team.\nThe event took place at Woodward Park. Max completed the four-mile course in 21:15.19. His result earned him first-team All-Northern California Regional honors at the start of his collegiate athletic career.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
